  "title": "XION (XION) Is Rebranding to VERONA (VERONA): Migration Details for Mudrex Users",
  "summary": "Mudrex will support the XION (XION) rebranding to VERONA (VERONA) and the associated token migration. As part of this transition, all eligible XION holdings on Mudrex will be automatically converted to VERONA at a fixed ratio of 1 XION = 1 VERONA. Users do not need to take any action to participate in the migration. […]",
